From uf0e02cc3862562f5 at groups.google.com  Thu Jan  2 20:50:44 2025
From: uf0e02cc3862562f5 at groups.google.com (Josh Twining)
Date: Thu, 02 Jan 2025 20:50:44 +0000
Subject: Re: [unmarked] Incorporating species-specific variables in MSOMs
Message-ID: <XKMtC4znp7E.nk7m14cECAAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
